#pragma code_page(65001)
// res/lang/sl.rc -- Slovenian, the strings of the interface for `[general] language = "sl"`.
//
// Stage E109, group B: the two string tables of this language -- the dialog block and the
// menu block -- in the order of en.rc. app.rc includes this file; where each string is seen and
// how much room it has is res/lang/context.tsv; tests/l10n.rs holds this file to en.rc.
//
// ⚠ In an .rc string a backslash is an escape -- one backslash is written as two -- and a double
// quote inside a string is written as two double quotes. The code page line above is this
// file's own: without it rc.exe reads the file in the ANSI code page, silently.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Slovenian — `[general] language = "sl"`.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
